        "Content": "Kelly Hudson Properties proudly present this excellent 3 bedroom end of terrace property to the market. \r\n\r\nOffering clean lines and modern décor throughout, this property is one not to be missed having been meticulously well maintained by its current owners and comes to the market in turnkey condition. The property offers an abundance of bright airy and spacious living accommodation and comprises of an entrance hallway, kitchen/dining with patio doors to enclosed pergola area which has pvc double doors leading to garden, sitting room and guest wc all downstairs. Upstairs is the family bathroom and 3 bedrooms, the main of which is ensuite. \r\n\r\nLocated in a much sought after location, this property is within easy walking \r\ndistance to all local amenities including primary and secondary schools, shops, \r\nsupermarkets, restaurants and much more. This is an ideal choice for any commuter. Access to the motorway  M4 is c.20 minute drive away. \r\n\r\nViewing of this property comes highly recommended strictly by prior appointment with Agent only.  \r\n\r\nACCOMMODATION:\r\n\r\nHallway: Tiles, downstairs storage, telephone point, alarm point\r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining:  Tiles, light fitting, fully fitted kitchen, tiled splash back area, sink, fridge freezer, dishwasher, oven , hob, extractor fan, island unit, patio door to enclosed pergola area with pvc double doors leading to garden area\r\n\r\nGuest WC:  Tiles, WHB, WC,\r\n\r\nSitting Room: Fireplace, curtains, blinds, tiles\r\n\r\nBathroom: Free standing bath, tiled floor, tiled surround, WHB, WC\r\n\r\nBedroom 1: Wooden flooring, fitted wardrobe, curtains, blinds\r\n\r\nEnsuite: WC, WHB, tiled floor, tiled surround\r\n\r\nBedroom 2: Wooden flooring, blinds\r\n\r\nBedroom 3: Wooden flooring, blinds\r\n\r\n\r\nFeatures\r\n\r\nFully alarmed\r\nComposite hall door\r\nSelected curtains and light fittings included\r\nAttic access, stira stairs, partial flooring\r\nPVC double glazed windows\r\nOutside tap\r\nOutside light\r\nPatio area to rear \r\nBarna Shed\r\nSide Gate\r\nBack Garden orientation—west\r\nLocated in a cul de sac\r\nCorner site\r\nOil fired central heating\r\nMains water\r\nMains sewage\r\nBuilt in 2004\r\nc.86.35 sqm / c.929.46 sqft\r\n\r\nVIEWING IS STRICTLY BY APPOINTMENT ONLY.\r\n\r\nThe above particulars are issued by Kelly Hudson Properties on the understanding that all negotiations are conducted through them. Every care is \r\ntaken in preparing particulars that are issued for guidance only and the firm do not hold themselves responsible for any inaccuracies. \t\r\n\r\nLicence No:001492"
